hc=Zg5RhEeuGwgQ7kNvwEOYEhv&_nc_oc=Adrg8oC_xkPiBE9vEcHYQJGTcqokbzh01KNwylHfY29XkJL0MEg9FY-8mq1sDgq4YS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI5qfiTmneY3KndzEo3SzWxxA9NIyGICbGISY-ASaYQXA&oe=6AAE98B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OMp8sRcZpq0Q7kNvwH-ckxM&_nc_oc=AdqiKz2AVoig75a_6QL-uHsXqHiS4hukdUfoMUGysexhFq7wIDf6ipABIEYgYZhJT-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDolxUHis4XHpg8HAZaznSSTeI-M38Q1dNzW3-SOIVbA&oe=6AAE9A4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LAtzwYCz7-kQ7kNvwGiNFWq&_nc_oc=AdpB-epjIrarttxwRKJ4-c8fzXgzYWdXAYemQxJ6Vz2Q9EC3qrmmltCKPMu7caExNNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL8RDxb7ZI8AAdvEeUyQGm5hadiGgWNb1LyseG81h9gtw&oe=6AAE876F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zqhv-UpuVFsQ7kNvwGQC6Gm&_nc_oc=AdpV8NVVdPJrKyIi__OJySfA3B_63jthMTUXx2VkMlUECiK3_a7SJvderQuwo-vd22s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI_31sX9CUk84Y5KKTwR8OebYKImd2nEhJ9-3f0tfPdkA&oe=6AAEA903"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6JvbChsIlQkQ7kNvwGr1Q5z&_nc_oc=Adr3RcjlDUvmAXs4KzFal8veTgackwJfYQpyLw7ttuXy6ID1W6Ws43_dLaHThWEOgXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLF4PypMX-felKYCEbf7IUWcd5_y4PtyI38XFd4EHeWQA&oe=6AAEA158"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MlwHhKqdK-gQ7kNvwHPNyGN&_nc_oc=Adp1GBaw0XJLWMQPvRDVLtBlZcCz03ljaQZb-ubISl00eLzncE2vHcPgmgfyX_Ct91c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJnkD3lp_9lK7WMKfY-K79OudeLzwNHadwK2umadHLVhA&oe=6AAEB47C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_13386805878482