p-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zqhv-UpuVFsQ7kNvwGQC6Gm&_nc_oc=AdpV8NVVdPJrKyIi__OJySfA3B_63jthMTUXx2VkMlUECiK3_a7SJvderQuwo-vd22s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI_31sX9CUk84Y5KKTwR8OebYKImd2nEhJ9-3f0tfPdkA&oe=6AAEA903"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6JvbChsIlQkQ7kNvwGr1Q5z&_nc_oc=Adr3RcjlDUvmAXs4KzFal8veTgackwJfYQpyLw7ttuXy6ID1W6Ws43_dLaHThWEOgXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLF4PypMX-felKYCEbf7IUWcd5_y4PtyI38XFd4EHeWQA&oe=6AAEA158"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MlwHhKqdK-gQ7kNvwHPNyGN&_nc_oc=Adp1GBaw0XJLWMQPvRDVLtBlZcCz03ljaQZb-ubISl00eLzncE2vHcPgmgfyX_Ct91c&_nc_zt=3&_n